  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nQ is 12% more than 156.\n\nP is 15% less than Q.\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nQ = 156 + 12% of 156\n\nP = Q - 15% of Q\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nQ = 156 + (12/100) × 156\n\nQ = 156 + 0.12 × 156\n\nQ = 156 + 18.72\n\nQ = 174.72\n\nP = 174.72 - (15/100) × 174.72\n\nP = 174.72 - 0.15 × 174.72\n\nP = 174.72 - 26.208\n\n⇒ P = 148.512\n\nThe value of P is 148.51 (approx).",
